# Internal docs — never deploy to the public site.
#
# This was a hand-maintained name-by-name list and it drifted: on 2026-08-07,
# LIFTOFFR_MASTER_PLAN.md, REVENUE_REVIEW_2026-08-07.md, RATE_CARD.md and
# PIVOT_DECISION_2026-08-02.md were all serving 200 at liftoffr.com — revenue
# figures, the offer ladder, brand-deal rates and a live security to-do, public
# and crawlable. Every new doc leaked by default until someone remembered to
# add it here.
#
# Now the default is inverted: NO markdown ships. The site is HTML + JS; if a
# .md ever genuinely needs to be public, un-ignore that one file explicitly
# with a `!` line below. (llms.txt and robots.txt are not .md and are
# unaffected.)
*.md
**/*.md

# Non-markdown internal files
lead-magnet/buy-zone-plan.html
logo-lab.html

# Dated backups. dashboard/index.html.backup-v3design-20260702 still held the
# 'buy weakness' / 'start scaling out' instruction strings removed from the live
# dashboards on 2026-08-20 — a reinfection source sitting inside the deploy.
*.backup-*
**/*.backup-*

# PAID DELIVERABLES — never deploy. Anything in this repo is served publicly:
# /lead-magnet/read-the-cycle.pdf returns 200 today, which is correct — that one
# is the free magnet. (bear-market-buy-zone.pdf and cycle-top-checklist.pdf were
# the free magnets until 20 Aug 2026; both are retired and 308 to read-the-cycle.)
# The $29 buy-plan PDF is NOT free. Committing it without this rule would publish
# the paid product as a free download.
product/
*.paid.pdf

# Test harnesses for js/attribution.js — never deploy.
js/*.test.js

# Dev utilities, not part of the site.
scripts/*.js
